  "notes": {
    "zh": "# MistTerm 1.2.10\n\n## 修复\n\n- **终端第一行不再被标签栏挡住**：标签移进标题栏后，终端第一行上半截被裁掉的问题已修好。\n- **标签内容垂直居中**：标签里的状态圆点、文字和关闭按钮现在上下居中。\n",
    "en": "# MistTerm 1.2.10\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **First terminal line no longer clipped**: The top of the first terminal line is no longer hidden under the tab bar.\n- **Tab content vertically centered**: The status dot, label and close button in each tab are now vertically centered.\n"
  },
